ast_stream_start":"␀␀␀&amp;␀␀␀&lt;␀␀␀␀&gt;␀␀␀␀&quot;␀␀ok␀␀bad␀/ota␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'>␀␀␀<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀<title>Firmware update</title><style>␀␀␀:root{--bg:#f6f7fb;--fg:#0f172a;--muted:#526079;--card:#fff;--border:#d7dee9;--acc:#0ea5e9;--ok:#10b981;--bad:#ef4444}␀␀@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#07101f;--fg:#e8eefc;--muted:#a7b3cb;--card:#111a2c;--border:#26344f}}␀*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(900px 600px at 10% -10%,rgba(14,165,233,.18),transparent),var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 14px}.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin:0 0 14px;box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.10)}h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 8px}.muted{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}.msg{border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 14px;border:1px solid var(--border)}.ok{color:var(--ok)}.bad{color:var(--bad)}input{width:100%;padding:11px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;margin:8px 0 12px}button,a.btn{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--border);background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--acc),#f59e0b);color:#082f49;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}button.secondary,a.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--fg)}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;word-break:break-all}</style></head><body><div class='wrap'>␀<div class='card'><h1>Firmware update</h1><p class='muted'>Device: <code>␀␀␀</code><br>Current firmware: <strong>v␀␀</strong><br>Board: <strong>␀␀␀␀</strong> / ␀␀␀␀</p><p><a class='btn secondary' href='/'>Back to Web UI</a></p></div>␀␀␀<div class='msg ␀␀␀␀'>␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Automatic update</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has internet access. It downloads the latest board-specific app build from the project web flasher and installs it automatically.</p>␀␀<p class='muted'>Latest firmware: <code>␀␀␀␀</code></p><form id='ota-install-form' method='post' action='/ota/install'><button type='submit'>Download and install latest firmware</button></form>␀␀␀<p class='bad'>Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile. Upload a matching app-only firmware file manually.</p>␀␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Upload compiled file</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has no internet access. Select the matching app-only file such as <code>firmware-app-c3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-s3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-c5.bin</code>, or <code>firmware-app-c6.bin</code>. Do not upload the USB <code>firmware.bin</code> merged image here.</p>␀␀␀␀<form id='ota-upload-form' method='post' action='/ota/upload' enctype='multipart/form-data'>␀␀␀␀<input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin,application/octet-stream' required><button type='submit'>Upload and install file</button></form></div>␀␀<script>(function(){function replaceWithResponse(r){return r.text().then(function(t){document.open();document.write(t);document.close();});}function fail(e){alert('Update request failed: '+e);}var install=document.getElementById('ota-install-form');if(install){install.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();if(!confirm('Install firmware update now? The stream will stop and the device will reboot.'))return;fetch('/ota/install',{method:'POST',cache:'no-store',headers:{'X-ESP32MIC-CSRF':'1'}}).then(replaceWithResponse).catch(fail);});}var upload=document.getElementById('ota-upload-form');if(upload){upload.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();if(!confirm('Upload and install selected firmware now?'))return;fetch('/ota/upload',{method:'POST',cache:'no-store',headers:{'X-ESP32MIC-CSRF':'1'},body:new FormData(upload)}).then(replaceWithResponse).catch(fail);});}})();</script>␀␀␀␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀Firmware uploaded and installed. Device will reboot now.␀␀␀␀Upload failed: ␀Audio setting rejected: I2S restart failed, rolling back.␀␀␀Audio rollback failed; reboot recommended.␀␀key␀{"ok":false,"error":"missing_key"}␀␀mqtt_pass␀␀␀UI set: mqtt_pass=<hidden>␀␀UI set: ␀␀␀␀gain␀␀␀␀buffer␀␀shift␀␀␀wifi_tx␀auto_recovery␀␀␀off␀thr_mode␀␀␀␀auto␀␀␀␀manual␀␀min_rate␀␀␀␀check_interval␀␀sched_reset␀reset_hours␀cpu_freq␀␀␀␀hp_enable␀␀␀hp_cutoff␀␀␀oh_enable␀␀␀oh_limit␀␀␀␀time_offset␀stream_sched␀␀␀␀stream_start_min␀␀␀␀stream_stop_min␀deep_sleep_sched␀␀␀␀mdns_enable␀mdns_hostname␀␀␀mqtt_enable␀mqtt_host␀␀␀mqtt_port␀␀␀mqtt_user␀␀␀mqtt_topic␀␀mqtt_client_id␀␀mqtt_interval␀␀␀stream1_target␀␀stream2_target␀␀stream1_enabled␀stream2_enabled␀max_clients␀{"ok":false,"error":"unknown_key"}␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"invalid_value"}␀␀␀␀{"ok":true}␀UI action: factory_reset␀␀␀␀UI action: reboot␀␀␀UI action: mqtt_discovery␀␀␀UI action: network_reset (clearing Wi-Fi and rebooting)␀{"ok":false,"error":"bad_bssid"}␀␀␀␀UI action: wifi_reconnect (BSSID pinned)␀␀␀␀UI action: wifi_reconnect␀␀␀UI action: reset_i2s␀␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"i2s_restart_failed"}␀␀␀Web UI RTSP server disabled␀UI action: server_stop␀␀Server start blocked: thermal protection latched␀␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"thermal_latched"}␀␀UI action: server_start␀Thermal latch cleared manually.␀UI action: thermal_latch_clear␀␀{"ok":false}␀␀␀␀forbidden␀␀␀firmware.bin␀␀␀␀firmware-␀␀␀firmware-app-␀␀␀OTA upload starting␀OTA upload start: ␀␀Update begin failed: ␀␀␀Flash write failed: ␀␀␀␀Update end failed: ␀Update was not fully written.␀␀␀OTA upload installed, bytes=␀␀␀␀Upload aborted.␀/ota/install␀␀␀␀/ota/upload␀/api/status␀/api/audio_status␀␀␀/api/perf_status␀␀␀␀/api/thermal␀␀␀␀/api/thermal/clear␀␀/api/logs␀␀␀/api/action/server_start␀␀␀␀/api/action/server_stop␀/api/action/reset_i2s␀␀␀/api/action/time_sync␀␀␀/api/action/wifi_reconnect␀␀/api/action/network_reset␀␀␀/api/action/mqtt_discovery␀␀/api/action/reboot␀␀/api/action/factory_re